OL,3,GNEWSANeonatal unit rated 'good' despite
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeonatal services at Oxford's John
OL,7,FRadcliffe Hospital have been rated
OL,8,F"good" by inspectors, despite years of
OL,9,Fconcerns about maternity care at the
OL,10,Fsame trust.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission inspected
OL,13,Fthe unit in January, the first time it
OL,14,Fassessed neonatal care independently of
OL,15,Fmaternity services, rating it "good" in
OL,16,Fall five categories.
OL,18,FIt follows an inspection in October
OL,19,Fthat also rated the John Radcliffe's
OL,20,Fmaternity services "good" overall,
OL,21,Fthough inspectors found four regulatory
OL,22,Fbreaches.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
